  "notes": "{加|くわ}える is an ichidan verb meaning to add or append.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pair: {加|くわ}わる (intransitive - to join, be added)\n\nPARTICLE PATTERNS:\n- AにBを{加|くわ}える: to add B to A\n- {説明|せつめい}を{加|くわ}える: to add an explanation\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {変更|へんこう}を{加|くわ}える: to make changes\n- {手|て}を{加|くわ}える: to modify, work on\n- {攻撃|こうげき}を{加|くわ}える: to attack (inflict an attack)\n- {危害|きがい}を{加|くわ}える: to harm\n\nDON'T CONFUSE:\n- {加|くわ}える: to add\n- {咥|くわ}える: to hold in mouth (different kanji and meaning)",
